& [Observed]
  + corrected cleanup proof build produced a different package manifest despite the same source commit archive digest artifact count and aggregate bytes

& [Cause]
  + builder copied public evidence and its PowerShell package verifier from the advancing live working tree rather than the immutable core Git archive

& [Correction]
  + copy all six public evidence files from the extracted4fdd29cb archive and remove the unpinned PowerShell verifier from package membership
